# src/apps/daemon/internal/runtime/firewall

## Purpose
Coordinates runtime firewall state required by LumiNet networking behavior.

## Contents
Contains Go firewall rules/models and apply, update, or teardown orchestration used while the daemon is running.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by runtime/network lifecycle code and delegates platform-specific mutation through lower platform/system boundaries.

## Invariants
Firewall changes are validated, idempotent or safely repeatable, and paired with rollback/cleanup; failures must not be reported as applied state, and daemon shutdown must release rules it owns without deleting unrelated system policy.